Optional Java development components / 可选 Java 开发组件

The main installer contains the pinned catalog only. JDK and Maven archives are
downloaded or imported on request; their LICENSE and NOTICE files remain in the
installed component directories.
主安装包仅包含固定版本清单。JDK 与 Maven 归档按需下载或导入，其 LICENSE 和
NOTICE 文件保留在所安装的组件目录内。

Eclipse Temurin OpenJDK: https://adoptium.net/
Source: https://github.com/adoptium/temurin-build
License: GPL-2.0 with the Classpath Exception and bundled third-party notices.

Azul Zulu OpenJDK 8 for macOS Apple Silicon: https://www.azul.com/downloads/
Source: https://github.com/zulu-openjdk/zulu-openjdk
License: GPL-2.0 with the Classpath Exception and bundled third-party notices.

Apache Maven: https://maven.apache.org/
Source: https://github.com/apache/maven
License: Apache-2.0 and bundled third-party notices.

scripts/java-components.mjs refreshes the catalog from official package metadata.
Maven's archive is verified against the publisher's SHA-512 before its SHA-256
and exact size enter the catalog. Runtime installation requires the pinned size
and SHA-256 and does not resolve mutable latest-version endpoints.
scripts/java-components.mjs 从官方包元数据刷新清单。Maven 归档先通过发布方 SHA-512
校验，再将 SHA-256 与准确大小写入清单。安装时验证固定大小及 SHA-256，不查询可变的
最新版本接口。
